  "maintenanceChanges": [
    "Select the packaged self-contained ManusCC0 Web loading shell with all three approved weights and its license.",
    "Documentation-only successor: require unused-asset housekeeping before the final checkpoint or publication; inherited gameplay, scenes and media remain unchanged.",
    "Documentation-only successor: route unresolved new-game asset-production choices through Game Blueprint; preserve the tool-unavailable and existing-game fallback, inherited gameplay, scenes, assets, fonts and locks.",
    "Round terrain and question-block texture perimeters without changing collision geometry; anchor alpha-aware enemy rendering and stomp squash to the collider foot baseline.",
    "Bind bundled ManusCC0 composite fonts after first import using a runtime autoload, preserving custom theme styles and explicit font overrides.",
    "Use finite smoke checks and receipt-verified export paths where legacy starter scripts require them; gameplay and BGM bytes/defaults are preserved.",
    "Route browser BGM through the canonical independent Web Audio renderer with one-time decoded buffer caching and Godot native fallback; preserve existing soundtrack bytes, gain, mute, pause and transition behavior.",
    "Add complete English/Simplified Chinese UI catalogs, an accessible EN/CN title selector, English first-launch default, saved language preference and native/export localization checks; preserve gameplay, assets, CC0 fonts and existing save identity.",
    "Rename the template category to Horizontal Platformer while preserving stable logical IDs and the playable sample theme.",
    "2026-09-25 typography polish: ManusCC0 retired from this revision; template-specific OFL display/body faces plus the Noto Sans SC subset (6,547-codepoint runtime CJK repertoire) ship as subset WOFF2 with adjacent OFL texts, restored from assets.lock.json (asset version 2026.09.25-typography-v1); first launch follows the browser/system language (zh* -> Simplified Chinese) unless a saved choice exists; loaders embed a Noto Sans SC subset."
